    {
      "id": "p9_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        450.0,
        900.0,
        495.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "概括地说，把一些确定的对象的全体叫做集合(set)，简称集. 集合通常用大写字母 A、B、C……表示."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        495.0,
        900.0,
        535.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "集合所含的各个对象叫做该集合的元素(element). 元素通常用小写字母 a、b、c……表示."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b6",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        535.0,
        900.0,
        605.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "如果 a 是集合 A 的元素，就记作 a∈A，读作“a 属于 A”；如果 a 不是集合 A 的元素，就记作 a∉A，读作“a 不属于 A”. 例如，若 A 是由数 1、3、5、7、9 组成的集合，则 1∈A，2∉A."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b7",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        605.0,
        900.0,
        695.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "集合的元素是确定的. 也就是说，给定一个集合，一个对象在不在这个集合中就确定了. 例如，“我国的直辖市”组成一个集合，北京、上海、天津、重庆在这个集合中，而杭州、南京、深圳等城市不在这个集合中."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b8",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        695.0,
        900.0,
        760.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "一些不确定的对象不能组成一个集合. 例如，“我们班里高个子的同学”不能组成一个集合. 因为“高个子”的标准不够明确、具体，所以“我们班里高个子的同学”是不确定的."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b9",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        760.0,
        900.0,
        805.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "一个给定集合中的各个元素是互不相同的，即一个元素在同一个集合中是不能重复出现的."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b10",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        805.0,
        900.0,
        845.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "如果两个集合 A 与 B 的组成元素完全相同，就称这两个集合相等，记作 A=B."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null,
        "caption": null,
        "table_html": null,
        "latex": null,
        "asset_key": null,
        "asset_url": null,
        "text_segments": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "如果两个集合",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": " A ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "与",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": " B ",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "raw": "的组成元素完全相同，就称这两个集合相等，记作",
            "latex": null,
            "valid": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "math",
            "raw": " A=B.",
            "latex": "A = B .",
            "valid": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p9_b11",
      "kind": "text",
      "content_type": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        330.0,
        845.0,
        850.0,
        870.0
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "元素个数有限的集合称为有限集，否则就称为无限集."
          ]
        },
